 "description": "The maze world's capability map: 2 weak baseline strategies (greedy_amnesia, wall_follower) the agent is GIVEN, plus the routing PRIMITIVES it already UNDERSTANDS (map_memory, distance_field, gradient_descent). When the baselines fall short the compose_routing_on_shortfall RULE composes a better strategy from those primitives itself \u2014 a graph-native design act, no teacher and no host Python.",
